OL,3,GNEWSAGareth Gates' panto co-star picked
OL,4,Afrom 200 hopefuls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA performer is ready to step into the
OL,7,Fshoes of a Disney princess after being
OL,8,Fselected from more than 200 hopefuls in
OL,9,Fa Norfolk theatre's first pantomime for
OL,10,F30 years.
OL,12,FMore than 200 hopefuls auditioned in
OL,13,FApril for the opportunity to play the
OL,14,Frole of Belle in Beauty & The Beast at
OL,15,Fthe Britannia Theatre in Great
OL,16,FYarmouth, Norfolk, over the festive
OL,17,Fseason.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
