OL,3,GNEWSAGareth Gates' panto co-star picked
OL,4,Afrom 200 hopefuls
OL,5,
OL,6,FRosanna Roscoe was announced for her
OL,7,Ffirst professional role opposite
OL,8,Fsinging star Gareth Gates, who plays
OL,9,Fthe cursed prince and is also
OL,10,Fco-producer.
OL,12,FShe said: "The search for a local Belle
OL,13,Fwas really important to the team... I
OL,14,Fhave lots of family from Norfolk and my
OL,15,Fnan still lives there now."
